  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Brown the beef on all sides, about 5 minutes. Remove from pot and set aside.",
    "Reduce heat to medium and cook the onion until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic, ginger, cumin, cinnamon, turmeric, paprika, salt, and pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the browned beef back to the pot, along with the dried apricots and 2 cups of water.",
    "Bring to a boil, then cover and transfer to the oven.",
    "Braise for 2 1/2 hours, or until the beef is tender and the sauce has thickened.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
